# Casks and VS Code extensions only. Formulae and Mac App Store apps are
# declared in mise/conf.d/packages.toml ([bootstrap.packages]) and installed by mise;
# casks stay on Homebrew because mise's cask support is intentionally narrow.
# Applied by the brew:casks task (post-packages hook) via `brew bundle`.
# 1Password must live in /Applications; everything else goes to ~/Applications
# via HOMEBREW_CASK_OPTS.
